<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Trillium Lake Loop (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:142-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:trillium-lake-sno-park (OSM parking way/148019331); confidence: high; pdf_page: 143; book_elev_ft: 3830</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction</name><desc>source: OSM junction of Trillium Lake Road NF 2656 and NF 2650-131 (East Perry Vickers Road), 0.5 mi down 2656 from the sno-park; confidence: high; pdf_page: 144; book_elev_ft: 3600; quote: The Snow Bunny Hill road descends several hundred yards, flattens out, crosses a creek, then reaches the airstrip junction ... a total distance of 0.5 mile.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.265815" lon="-121.737354"><ele>1102.8</ele><name>Dam at the foot of the lake (2656 / 2612 junction)</name><desc>source: OSM junction of NF 2656 and Still Creek Road NF 2612 at the south (dam) end of Trillium Lake; confidence: high; pdf_page: 145; book_elev_ft: 3600; quote: curves right to a gentle descent to the dam at the foot of the lake (3,600 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280905" lon="-121.741343"><ele>1137.8</ele><name>Westside Divide</name><desc>source: OSM junction of Sherar Burn Road NF 2613 and Still Creek Road NF 2612; confidence: high; pdf_page: 145; book_elev_ft: 3720; quote: reach the Westside Divide, the junction of the Sherar Burn and Still Creek roads</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.286242" lon="-121.737580"><ele>1117.5</ele><name>Pioneer Graves junction</name><desc>source: OSM junction of East Chimney Rock Road and NF 2650-131 at the west edge of Summit Meadows; book map 32 puts the junction at the meadows' NW corner, 0.5 mi from the divide; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 145; quote: along the level, winding road across a flat leading to the Pioneer Graves junction, at the north end of Summit Meadows</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction (return)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: high; pdf_page: 145; quote: follow the road or meadow south to the airstrip junction</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park (finish)</name><desc>source: as start; confidence: high</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Trillium Lake Loop (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>1. Trillium Lake Sno-Park -&gt; Airstrip junction: osm (high), 0.48 mi | 2. Airstrip junction -&gt; Dam at the foot of the lake (2656 / 2612 junction): osm (high), 1.24 mi | 3. Dam at the foot of the lake (2656 / 2612 junction) -&gt; Westside Divide: osm (high), 1.41 mi | 4. Westside Divide -&gt; Pioneer Graves junction: osm (medium), 0.48 mi | 5. Pioneer Graves junction -&gt; Airstrip junction (return): osm (medium), 0.52 mi | 6. Airstrip junction (return) -&gt; Trillium Lake Sno-Park (finish): osm (high), 0.48 mi</desc>
